# Command Subadjunct grants vigilance to itself and your Memnite, not your nonartifact Llanowar Elves, your Mox Pearl, or
# Bot2's Memnite. On Bot1's turn all three creatures attack: only the two artifact creatures stay untapped (CR 613.1f, 702.20a, 702.20b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Command Subadjunct
Memnite
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Plains
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Command Subadjunct.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Command Subadjunct.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Command Subadjunct > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2; Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Command Subadjunct.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot1.Battlefield.Command Subadjunct.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Life = 16
Stack.Count = 0
